SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:---------------------------------\nLesson 2 Epic Epithets for 
 Cosmo\n---------------------------------\n\nIn this activity\, you will cr
 eate an epic epithet for Cosmo the Cougar. This practice\, and seeing the 
 epithets your peers will create\, will help you to better identify and hig
 hlight epithets for each character in the Iliad Project later in this less
 on. \n\nMain Post\n---------\n\nClick Reply at the bottom and complete th
 e following steps to know what to include in your post.\n\nSince your clas
 smates are relying on you to post on time so they can respond\, late posts
  will not be accepted. \n\nStep 1: Find Cosmo\n------------------\n\nFind
  an online image or video clip of Cosmo the Cougar. Embed a screenshot or 
 add a video link to your post.\n\nEnsure you adjust the size of your image
  by dragging the bottom right-hand corner. Also\, please use the embed fea
 ture\, and not the attach button. This way\, your peers won't need to down
 load the image (see screenshot below).\n\n[Click Upload image\, not Attach
 ] (LINK.PLACEHOLDER_63e025a962506d9f3f0947f2bf56a956)\n\nStep 2: Create an
  Epic Epithet\n------------------------------\n\nCreate your own epic epit
 het that describes Cosmo's character\, his ability\, or his looks based on
  your image or video clip.\n\nIt should look something like ____-____ Cosm
 o or Cosmo of the _____-_____. \n\nStep 3: Give Rationale for Epithet \n
 -----------------------------------\n\nAfter you write the epithet\, write
  a minimum of one sentence describing how this epithet applies specifica
 lly to Cosmo.\n\nOnce you have made your main post\, you will be able to s
 ee your peers' posts. It is just fine if your image or epithet duplicates 
 what some of your peers have done.\n\nTwo Comments\n------------\n\nChoose
  two classmates’ posts and leave a short\, thoughtful comment on each.\n
 \nIn each comment\, make one meaningful connection. You might:\n\n* Explai
 n how the epithet gave you a new way to think about Cosmo.\n\n* Point out 
 a specific connection between the image and the epithet.\n\n* Share a time
  when you saw Cosmo demonstrating why that epithet fits so well.\n\nYour c
 omment should refer to something specific in the post. A brief reaction su
 ch as “Cool epithet” does not count by itself.\n\nGood Example: Your e
 pithet reminds me of when I saw Cosmo walk down the Marriott Center stairs
  at a basketball game while doing a handstand. His energy never slowed dow
 n\, so your epithet fits him perfectly!\n\nIn most careers\, your work dep
 ends on others. Learning to wait\, plan ahead\, and follow through is a va
 luable professional skill. Therefore\, if you post your main video first o
 r second\, set a reminder to return and respond after two peers have poste
 d.\n\nGrading\n-------\n\nClick on the     button in the top right-han
 d corner to see the Rubric.\n\nModule Item Completion (browser only)
