 r-title dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr" style="margin-
 top: 0px\;">Introduce Yourself</span></h2>\n</header>\n<div class="dp-cont
 ent-block dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-border-sty
 le-solid dp-border-dir-all dp-shadow-b1" style="margin: 50px 70px 40px\; p
 adding: 25px 35px\; background-color: #ffffff\; color: #000000\; border-wi
 dth: 3px\; border-color: #005a38\;">\n<p class="lead">In this activity\, y
 ou will explore how a “second language” can come from an interest\, sk
 ill\, or community. Then you will introduce yourself in a short video and 
 respond to two classmates.</p>\n<div class="dp-callout dp-callout-placehol
 der card dp-callout-position-default dp-callout-type-info dp-callout-color
 -lg-danger dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="margin-top: 25px\;">\n<div cla
 ss="dp-callout-side-emphasis"><i class="dp-icon dp-default-icon fas fa-exc
 lamation-triangle">​</i></div>\n<div class="card-body">\n<h3 class="card
 -title" style="font-size: 23px\;">Join a Group Before Posting</h3>\n<p cla
 ss="card-text">Ensure you have completed the <a title="Join a Group" href=
 "LINK.PLACEHOLDER_df2696e4db9fd57edfe986e674dfb95c" target="_blank" data-c
 ourse-type="quizzes" data-published="true">Join a Group</a> quiz before yo
 u post to this discussion board. If not\, your post will appear on the gen
 eral board that none of your peers can see\, and you will be unable to see
  your peers' posts.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="dp-content-bl
 ock dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-shadow-b1 dp-bor
 der-dir-none" style="margin: 50px 70px 40px\; padding: 0px 35px 25px\; bac
 kground-color: #ffffff\; color: #000000\; border-width: 5px 0px 0px\; bord
 er-color: #005a38\;">\n<h3 id="what-to-submit" class="dp-border-dir-tblr d
 p-border-style-solid dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr" s
 tyle="border-width: 0px\; padding-left: 22px\; padding-bottom: 10px\; padd
 ing-top: 12px\; border-color: #005a38\; color: #ffffff\; margin: 0px -35px
  30px\; font-size: 24px\; background-color: #005a38\;"><strong>Read Articl
 e</strong></h3>\n<p>Before you complete your post\, read the following two
 -page article from the BYU College of Humanities. Think about what one of 
 your "second languages" could be.&nbsp\;</p>\n<p><a class="instructure_fil
 e_link instructure_scribd_file auto_open" title="whats_your_second_languag
 e.pdf" href="LINK.PLACEHOLDER_a8fa98395f41259abc558210c8d21f9d" target="_b
 lank" data-canvas-previewable="false" data-api-endpoint="https://byu.instr
 ucture.com/api/v1/courses/35466/files/13601488" data-api-returntype="File"
 >What's Your Second Language?</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class="dp-content-bloc
 k dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-shadow-b1 dp-borde
 r-dir-none" style="margin: 50px 70px 40px\; padding: 0px 35px 25px\; backg
 round-color: #ffffff\; color: #000000\; border-width: 5px 0px 0px\; border
 -color: #005a38\;">\n<h3 id="what-to-submit" class="dp-border-dir-tblr dp-
 border-style-solid dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr" sty
 le="border-width: 0px\; padding-left: 22px\; padding-bottom: 10px\; paddin
 g-top: 12px\; border-color: #005a38\; color: #ffffff\; margin: 0px -35px 3
 0px\; font-size: 24px\; background-color: #005a38\;"><strong>Post Video Re
 sponse</strong></h3>\n<p>Record and post a <strong>1–2 minute video</str
 ong> for your small group. Using the article’s idea of a “second langu
 age\," address the following.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Introduce yourself and name o
 ne “second language” you speak.</li>\n<li>Share a word\, phrase\, gest
 ure\, or inside reference from that language. Explain what it means.</li>
 \n<li>Tell how you learned this language.</li>\n<li>Share how it shows who
  you are or helps you connect with others.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Your second lan
 guage could come from a hobby\, field of study\, culture\, community\, fan
 dom\, faith\, or other part of your life.</p>\n<details class="dp-margin-d
 irection-tblr" style="margin: 20px 25px 25px\;">\n<summary class="dp-hover
 -shadow-b1" style="cursor: pointer\; display: inline-block\; background: #
 e2eee9\; color: #000000\; border-radius: 6px\; padding: 8px 15px\; font-si
 ze: 15px\; border: 1px solid #005a38\;">How do I record a video in my post
 ?</summary>\n<div style="margin-top: 16px\; padding: 16px\; background: #f
 afafa\; border-radius: 6px\; border: 1px solid #edf1e5\;">\n<p style="marg
 in: 12px 0px\;">After you click Reply below\, complete the following steps
  to record your video.</p>\n<p style="margin: 12px 0px\;"><img style="disp
 lay: block\; margin-left: auto\; margin-right: auto\;" src="LINK.PLACEHOLD
 ER_b3b447133ff29b4dbec2f8ac39e2ab2d" alt="Click Upload/Record Media after 
 clicking Reply. Don't Attach a video." width="723" height="365" data-api-e
 ndpoint="https://byu.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/35466/files/13601393" 
 data-api-returntype="File"> &nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p>\n<img style="displa
 y: block\; margin-left: auto\; margin-right: auto\;" src="LINK.PLACEHOLDER
 _dca70a6f64f2597768189192bd07f73d" alt="Click on the Record button instead
  of uploading a file from the computer." width="711" height="494" data-api
 -endpoint="https://byu.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/35466/files/13601394
 " data-api-returntype="File"> &nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;\n<p><img style="displ
 ay: block\; margin-left: auto\; margin-right: auto\;" src="LINK.PLACEHOLDE
 R_6c38d6e42c979c53b0ab719367430c66" alt="Click the Start Recording button"
  width="711" height="573" data-api-endpoint="https://byu.instructure.com/a
 pi/v1/courses/35466/files/13601398" data-api-returntype="File"> &nbsp\; &n
 bsp\;&nbsp\;</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<blockquote class="dp-margin-directi
 on-tblr" style="background-color: #ffffff\; color: #000000\; margin-top: 3
 5px\; border-left-color: #f1c232\;">\n<p>Since your classmates are relying
  on you to post on time so they can respond\, late posts will not be accep
 ted.&nbsp\;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<div class="dp-content-block dp-ma
 rgin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-shadow-b1 dp-border-dir-n
 one" style="margin: 50px 70px 40px\; padding: 0px 35px 25px\; background-c
 olor: #ffffff\; color: #000000\; border-width: 5px 0px 0px\; border-color:
  #005a38\;">\n<h3 id="what-to-submit" class="dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-
 style-solid dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="bor
 der-width: 0px\; padding-left: 22px\; padding-bottom: 10px\; padding-top: 
 12px\; border-color: #005a38\; color: #ffffff\; margin: 0px -35px 30px\; f
 ont-size: 24px\; background-color: #005a38\;"><strong>Make Two Comments</s
 trong></h3>\n<p>Watch your group members’ videos and leave a short\, wri
 tten response for at least <em>two</em> classmates.</p>\n<p>In each respon
 se:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mention something specific from the video that caught y
 our attention.</li>\n<li>Share a brief reaction or personal connection.</l
 i>\n</ul>\n<p>Write 2–3 thoughtful and encouraging sentences.</p>\n<bloc
 kquote class="dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="background-color: #ffffff\;
  color: #000000\; margin-top: 35px\; border-left-color: #f1c232\;">\n<p>In
  most careers\, your work depends on others. Learning to wait\, plan ahead
 \, and follow through is a valuable professional skill. Therefore\, if you
  post your main video first or second\, set a reminder to return and respo
 nd after two peers have posted.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<div class="dp
 -content-block dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-shado
 w-b1 dp-border-dir-none" style="margin: 50px 70px 40px\; padding: 0px 35px
  25px\; background-color: #ffffff\; color: #000000\; border-width: 5px 0px
  0px\; border-color: #005A38\;">\n<h3 class="dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-
 style-solid dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="bor
 der-width: 0px\; padding-left: 22px\; padding-bottom: 10px\; padding-top: 
 12px\; border-color: #005a38\; color: #ffffff\; margin: 0px -35px 30px\; f
 ont-size: 24px\; background-color: #005a38\;"><strong>Grading</strong></h3
 >\n<p><span>Click on the&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</span><i class="dp-icon fas fa-elli
 psis-v" aria-hidden="true"><span class="dp-icon-content" style="display: n
 one\;">&nbsp\;</span></i><span>&nbsp\; button in the top right-hand corner
  to see the Rubric.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class="dp-content-block dp-pa
 dding-direction-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="padding: 20px 25px\;
  background-color: #005a38\; color: #ffffff\; margin-top: 55px\; margin-bo
 ttom: 0px\;">\n<div class="dp-progress-placeholder dp-module-progress-comp
 letion dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="display: none\; background-color: 
 #eeeeee\; color: #000000\;">Module Item Completion (browser only)</div>\n<
 /div>\n</div><script src="https://instructure-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/acc
