 \; border-color: #005a38\; color: #ffffff\; margin: 0px -40px 30px\; font-
 size: 24px\; background-color: #005a38\;"><strong>Context</strong></h3>\n<
 p data-path-to-node="2">Throughout time\, people have asked the same quest
 ion: How do I live a good life?</p>\n<p data-path-to-node="2">As a student
  right now\, you might be thinking something similar: Will what I’m doin
 g now help me live a good life? How do I live a good life in the present\,
  and how do I build a good life for the future? What will bring true happi
 ness\, fulfillment\, and meaning to my life?</p>\n<p data-path-to-node="2"
 >Throughout this course\, we will be looking at the many different ways We
 stern civilization has dealt with these questions. To assist you in your u
 nderstanding of these questions and ideas\, both past and present\, and to
  help you find an overarching and personalized theme to this course\, we a
 re going to start by learning about intellectual virtues and selecting a s
 pecific intellectual virtue you would like to practice during your time in
  IHUM 201. &nbsp\;</p>\n</div>\n<div class="dp-content-block dp-margin-dir
 ection-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-shadow-b1 dp-border-dir-none" sty
