  #eeeeee\; color: #c7c9c7\; margin-top: 8px\;">\n<p>Create your own epic e
 pithet that describes Cosmo's character\, his ability\, or his looks based
  on your image or video clip.</p>\n<p>It should look something like ____-_
 ___ Cosmo or Cosmo of the _____-_____.&nbsp\;</p>\n<h4 class="dp-margin-di
 rection-tblr cp-txt-dp-primary dp-text-bold" style="margin-top: 50px\; fon
 t-size: 22px\; margin-bottom: 10px\; color: #005a38\;">Step 3: Give Ration
 ale for Epithet&nbsp\;</h4>\n<hr class="dp-hr-solid-light dp-margin-direct
 ion-tblr" style="border-color: #eeeeee\; color: #c7c9c7\; margin-top: 8px
 \;">\n<p><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW127040909 BCX0">After you write th
 e epithet\, write a minimum of<span>&nbsp\;</span></span><span class="Norm
 alTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW127040909 BCX0">on
 e sentence</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW127040909 BCX0"><span>&nbs
 p\;</span>describing how this epithet applies specifically to Cosmo.</span
 ></p>\n<blockquote class="dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="background-colo
 r: #ffffff\; color: #000000\; margin-top: 35px\; border-left-color: #f1c23
 2\;">\n<p>Once you have made your main post\, you will be able to see your
  peers' posts. It is just fine if your image or epithet duplicates what so
 me of your peers have done.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<div class="dp-con
 tent-block dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-shadow-b1
  dp-border-dir-none" style="margin: 50px 70px 40px\; padding: 0px 35px 25p
 x\; background-color: #ffffff\; color: #000000\; border-width: 5px 0px 0px
 \; border-color: #005A38\;">\n<h3 class="dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-styl
 e-solid dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="border-
 width: 0px\; padding-left: 22px\; padding-bottom: 10px\; padding-top: 12px
 \; border-color: #005a38\; color: #ffffff\; margin: 0px -35px 30px\; font-
 size: 24px\; background-color: #005a38\;"><strong>Two Comments</strong></h
 3>\n<p>Choose <strong>two classmates’ posts</strong> and leave a short\,
  thoughtful comment on each.</p>\n<p>In each comment\, make one meaningful
  connection. You might:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Explain how the epithet gave you a 
 new way to think about Cosmo.</li>\n<li>Point out a specific connection be
 tween the image and the epithet.</li>\n<li>Share a time when you saw Cosmo
  demonstrating why that epithet fits so well.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Your comment
  should refer to something specific in the post. A brief reaction such as 
 “Cool epithet” does not count by itself.</p>\n<p style="padding-left: 
 40px\;"><strong>Good Example: </strong>Your epithet reminds me of when I s
 aw Cosmo walk down the Marriott Center stairs at a basketball game while d
 oing a handstand. His energy never slowed down\, so your epithet fits him 
 perfectly!</p>\n<blockquote class="dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="backgr
 ound-color: #ffffff\; color: #000000\; margin-top: 35px\; border-left-colo
 r: #f1c232\;">\n<p>In most careers\, your work depends on others. Learning
  to wait\, plan ahead\, and follow through is a valuable professional skil
 l. Therefore\, if you post your main video first or second\, set a reminde
 r to return and respond after two peers have posted.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<
 /div>\n<div class="dp-content-block dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-di
 rection-tblr dp-shadow-b1 dp-border-dir-none" style="margin: 50px 70px 40p
