 border-width: 5px 0px 0px\; border-color: #005A38\;">\n<h3 class="dp-borde
 r-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-margin-direc
 tion-tblr" style="border-width: 0px\; padding-left: 22px\; padding-bottom:
  10px\; padding-top: 12px\; border-color: #005a38\; color: #ffffff\; margi
 n: 0px -35px 30px\; font-size: 24px\; background-color: #005a38\;"><strong
 >Grading</strong></h3>\n<p><span>Click on the&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</span><i class
 ="dp-icon fas fa-ellipsis-v" aria-hidden="true"><span class="dp-icon-conte
 nt" style="display: none\;">&nbsp\;</span></i><span>&nbsp\; button in the 
 top right-hand corner to see the Rubric.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class="d
 p-content-block dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr" style=
