 >\n</div>\n<div class="dp-content-block dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-paddin
 g-direction-tblr dp-shadow-b1 dp-border-dir-none" style="margin: 50px 70px
  40px\; padding: 0px 35px 25px\; background-color: #ffffff\; color: #00000
 0\; border-width: 5px 0px 0px\; border-color: #005a38\;">\n<h3 id="archite
 ctural-terms" class="dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid dp-padding-d
 irection-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="border-width: 0px\; padding
 -left: 22px\; padding-bottom: 10px\; padding-top: 12px\; border-color: #00
 5a38\; color: #ffffff\; margin: 0px -35px 30px\; font-size: 24px\; backgro
 und-color: #005a38\;"><strong>Architectural Terms</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp
 \;Go to this page and read the article about the Doric and Ionic orders:</
 p>\n<div id="doric-ionic-reading" class="dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="
 margin: 24px auto 30px\; max-width: 600px\; font-family: Arial\, Helvetica
 \, sans-serif\; background: #fbf8ef\; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 8px\; bord
