 "><strong>Sketch a Greek Temple</strong></h3>\n<p>One of the best ways to 
 cement these terms in your memory is to physically draw and label the part
 s of a Greek temple and the Doric and Ionic orders.</p>\n<p>For this assig
 nment\, you are going to make three sketches. You may do a pen/pencil and 
