 your labeled sketch.</li>\n<li>Be sure to include the building’s name an
 d location.&nbsp\;</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>You may identif
 y any of the following elements. See the required number in your instructi
 ons above.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pediment</li>\n<li>Doric capital</li>\n<li>Ionic
  capital</li>\n<li>Stylobate</li>\n<li>Entablature</li>\n<li>Frieze</li>\n
 <li>Cornice</li>\n<li>Raking cornice</li>\n<li>Fluted columns</li>\n<li>Tr
 iglyph</li>\n<li>Metope</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote class="dp-margin-directio
 n-tblr" style="background-color: #ffffff\; color: #000000\; margin-top: 25
 px\; margin-bottom: 25px\; border-left-color: #005a38\;">\n<p><strong>Tip<
