  #005a38\; color: #ffffff\; margin: 0px -35px 30px\; font-size: 24px\; bac
 kground-color: #005a38\;"><strong>Instructions</strong></h3>\n<p><span>Dow
 nload a copy of <a href="https://research-ebsco-com.byu.idm.oclc.org/c/w2m
 2q6/ebook-viewer/pdf/ea6hcqojjz/page/pp_xiii" target="_blank">Antigone</a>
  to highlight. You do not need to download the entire book\, just the page
 s that encompass the play. You can do this by clicking the download button
