 ork before you submit it. </span></li>\n<li><span data-olk-copy-source="Me
 ssageBody">If this statement is not included in the submission comment\, t
 he assignment will not be graded.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Rem
 ember\, the annotation must be your own work. If you submit a PDF of someo
 ne else's work\, that is plagiarism. If you use AI in any way to annotate 
