 rong>Different Modern Adaptations</strong></h3>\n<p>Antigone has been rewr
 itten and restaged for many different cultures and countries. The fact tha
 t so many of these retellings have happened in the last century points to 
 the continued relevance of the play. Watch the following short video where
  Dr. Jeppesen will explain how Antigone has been retold in situations rang
 ing from Nazi occupation in France and Apartheid in South Africa to ISIS r
 ecruitment after the War on Terror.</p>\n<div class="dp-margin-direction-t
 blr" style="margin-top: 35px\; margin-bottom: 35px\;">\n<div class="dp-emb
