 d="what-to-submit" class="dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid dp-padd
 ing-direction-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="border-width: 0px\; pa
 dding-left: 22px\; padding-bottom: 10px\; padding-top: 12px\; border-color
 : #005a38\; color: #ffffff\; margin: 0px -35px 30px\; font-size: 24px\; ba
 ckground-color: #005a38\;"><strong>Post Video Response</strong></h3>\n<p>A
 fter watching <em>Who Owns the Parthenon Sculptures?</em>\, consider the a
 rguments presented in the video. Should the sculptures remain in the Briti
 sh Museum\, or should they be returned to Athens?</p>\n<p>Record and post 
 a <strong>1-2 minute video </strong>for your small group in which you:</p>
 \n<ol style="list-style-type: decimal\;">\n<li>State which position you su
 pport.</li>\n<li>Explain why\, using at least one example of supporting ev
 idence from the video as well as your own thought and feelings from person
 al experience.</li>\n<li>Briefly acknowledge one reason someone might supp
 ort the other position.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Your goal here is not to "win" an 
 argument but to share your perspective thoughtfully and respectfully. It i
 s okay to see value in both sides\, but decide which position you support 
 today. Your opinion may change in the future as you gain more knowledge an
 d experience and that is 100% okay\; this video simply captures what you t
 hink today.</p>\n<details class="dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="margin: 
 20px 25px 25px\;">\n<summary class="dp-hover-shadow-b1" style="cursor: poi
 nter\; display: inline-block\; background: #e2eee9\; color: #000000\; bord
 er-radius: 6px\; padding: 8px 15px\; font-size: 15px\; border: 1px solid #
 005a38\;">How do I record a video in my post?</summary>\n<div style="margi
 n-top: 16px\; padding: 16px\; background: #fafafa\; border-radius: 6px\; b
 order: 1px solid #edf1e5\;">\n<p style="margin: 12px 0px\;">After you clic
 k Reply below\, complete the following steps to record your video.</p>\n<p
  style="margin: 12px 0px\;"><img style="display: block\; margin-left: auto
 \; margin-right: auto\;" src="LINK.PLACEHOLDER_b3b447133ff29b4dbec2f8ac39e
 2ab2d" alt="Click Upload/Record Media after clicking Reply. Don't Attach a
  video." width="723" height="365" data-api-endpoint="https://byu.instructu
 re.com/api/v1/courses/35466/files/13601393" data-api-returntype="File"> &n
 bsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p>\n<img style="display: block\; margin-left: auto\;
  margin-right: auto\;" src="LINK.PLACEHOLDER_dca70a6f64f2597768189192bd07f
 73d" alt="Click on the Record button instead of uploading a file from the 
 computer." width="711" height="494" data-api-endpoint="https://byu.instruc
 ture.com/api/v1/courses/35466/files/13601394" data-api-returntype="File"> 
 &nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;\n<p><img style="display: block\; margin-left: auto
 \; margin-right: auto\;" src="LINK.PLACEHOLDER_6c38d6e42c979c53b0ab7193674
 30c66" alt="Click the Start Recording button" width="711" height="573" dat
 a-api-endpoint="https://byu.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/35466/files/136
 01398" data-api-returntype="File"> &nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p>\n</div>\n</d
 etails>\n<blockquote class="dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="background-co
 lor: #ffffff\; color: #000000\; margin-top: 35px\; border-left-color: #f1c
 232\;">\n<p>Since your classmates are relying on you to post on time so th
 ey can respond\, late posts will not be accepted.&nbsp\;</p>\n</blockquote
 >\n</div>\n<div class="dp-content-block dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-paddin
 g-direction-tblr dp-shadow-b1 dp-border-dir-none" style="margin: 50px 70px
  40px\; padding: 0px 35px 25px\; background-color: #ffffff\; color: #00000
 0\; border-width: 5px 0px 0px\; border-color: #005a38\;">\n<h3 id="what-to
 -submit" class="dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid dp-padding-direct
 ion-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="border-width: 0px\; padding-left
 : 22px\; padding-bottom: 10px\; padding-top: 12px\; border-color: #005a38
 \; color: #ffffff\; margin: 0px -35px 30px\; font-size: 24px\; background-
 color: #005a38\;"><strong>Make Two Comments</strong></h3>\n<p>Watch the vi
 deos posted by your group members and give a written response to at least 
 two classmates.</p>\n<p>In each response:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Identify a specif
 ic idea from their videos that stood out to you.</li>\n<li>Explain whether
  that idea reinforced\, challenged\, or added to your own thinking.</li>\n
 <li>Respond respectfully\, whether you agree or disagree.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>
 The goal is to show that you thoughtfully and respectfully considered pers
 pectives other than your own. A response needs to be much more than "Cool"
  or "I agree." It needs to show that you watched\, listened to\, and thoug
 ht about their point of view. You are welcome to ask further questions and
  turn this into a conversation\, but your grade is based on your first res
 ponse.&nbsp\;<strong></strong></p>\n<blockquote class="dp-margin-direction
 -tblr" style="background-color: #ffffff\; color: #000000\; margin-top: 35p
 x\; border-left-color: #f1c232\;">\n<p>In most careers\, your work depends
  on others. Learning to wait\, plan ahead\, and follow through is a valuab
 le professional skill. Therefore\, if you post your main video first or se
 cond\, set a reminder to return and respond after two peers have posted.</
 p>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<div class="dp-content-block dp-margin-directio
 n-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-shadow-b1 dp-border-dir-none" style="m
 argin: 50px 70px 40px\; padding: 0px 35px 25px\; background-color: #ffffff
 \; color: #000000\; border-width: 5px 0px 0px\; border-color: #005A38\;">
 \n<h3 class="dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid dp-padding-direction
 -tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="border-width: 0px\; padding-left: 2
 2px\; padding-bottom: 10px\; padding-top: 12px\; border-color: #005a38\; c
