  class="dp-icon-content" style="display: none\;">&nbsp\;</span></i><span>&
 nbsp\; button in the top right-hand corner to see the Rubric.</span></p>\n
 </div>\n<div class="dp-content-block dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-margin-d
