 0px\; font-size: 20px\; margin-bottom: 10px\; color: #005a38\;">Dress Up a
 nd Take a Photo</h4>\n<hr class="dp-hr-solid-light dp-margin-direction-tbl
 r" style="border-color: #eeeeee\; color: #c7c9c7\; margin-top: 8px\; margi
 n-bottom: 20px\;">\n<p>Dress up for Halloween in a costume inspired by you
 r historical and artistic learning in this class and take a photo of yours
 elf.&nbsp\;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ensure that your costume is BYU-appropriate.</l
 i>\n<li>Must be a photo from this semester (i.e.\, no middle school or hig
 h school Halloween costumes).</li>\n<li>Should come from a time period dis
 cussed in this class.</li>\n<li>AI generated images are not allowed.</li>
 \n<li>Make it fun! Roommates and spouses are welcome to join you!</li>\n</
 ul>\n<p>Keep it simple and use what you already have on hand to represent 
 the art\, a person\, or a historical time period time period you've studie
 d in this course so far. You do not need to go to a costume store to come 
 up with a good costume.&nbsp\;</p>\n<h4 class="dp-margin-direction-tblr cp
