BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Watch "Artful" Episodes (Extra Credit) [IHUM 201-022]
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261210
DTSTAMP:20260830T222100Z
UID:event-assignment-1475752
SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:-------------------------------------\nExtra Credit Watch "Art
 ful" Episodes\n-------------------------------------\n\nThis optional acti
 vity can increase your Unit Checks grade percentage by up to 1%.\n\nInstru
 ctions\n------------\n\nWatch\n-----\n\nWatch four episodes of the BYU TV
  series “Artful.” Each episode is 25-30 minutes long and features two 
 or three artists. You may watch the show online at the link below\, or on 
 your TV on the BYU TV channel. Please be sure to select episodes that feat
 ure two to three artists so that your assignment counts. \n\n[BYUtv serie
 s ArtfulLinks to an external site.] (https://www.byutv.org/artful)\n\nWrit
 e\n-----\n\nAs with all writing assignments in this course\, AI cannot be 
 used for any part of your submission. This needs to be all your own though
 ts from beginning to end.\n\nFor your written assignment\, complete the fo
 llowing.\n\n*\n\nWrite a separate paragraph about each artist featured in 
 the four episodes you watched. This means you will have 8-12 paragraphs (4
  episode\, 2-3 artists per episode). Each paragraph should:\n\n* Identify 
 the artist by name.\n\n*\n\nDiscuss some of the main stylistic and themati
 c elements unique to the artist.\n\n*\n\nDiscuss whether or not their art 
 shares any characteristics with time periods we have studied in class--doe
 s anything about it remind you of anything we've studied or is it complete
 ly different.\n\n* Share one observation by this artist that you found per
 sonally applicable in your own life.\n\n*\n\nWrite a final paragraph ident
 ifying one artwork from the episodes you watched that is your overall fa
 vorite artwork among the many you saw. In this final paragraph\n\n* Identi
 fy the artist and title of the work.\n\n* Explain why this particular work
  was your favorite. This needs to be more than just "I like it." Write abo
 ut the art in detail. Write about your affinity for it in detail. This sho
 uld be a practice in used the language of visual art you are learning in t
 his course.  \n\nWhat to Submit\n--------------\n\nSubmit your finished r
 eport as a DOCX or PDF file.\n\nModule Item Completion (browser only)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://byu.instructure.com/calendar?include_contexts=course
 _36390&month=12&year=2026#assignment_1475752
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://instruct
