 ee\; color: #c7c9c7\; margin-top: 8px\; margin-bottom: 20px\;">\n<p><span>
 Watch&nbsp\;</span><strong>four</strong><span> episodes of the BYU TV seri
 es “Artful.” Each episode is 25-30 minutes long and features two or th
 ree artists. You may watch the show online at the link below\, or on your 
