 7\; margin-top: 8px\; margin-bottom: 20px\;">\n<p><span data-olk-copy-sour
 ce="MessageBody">As with all writing assignments in this course\, AI canno
 t be used for any part of your submission. This needs to be all your own t
 houghts from beginning to end.</span></p>\n<p><span data-olk-copy-source="
 MessageBody">For your written assignment\, complete the following.</span><
 /p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p role="presentation">Write a separate paragraph about e
 ach artist featured in the four episodes you watched. This means you will 
 have 8-12 paragraphs (4 episode\, 2-3 artists per episode). Each paragraph
  should:</p>\n</li>\n<ul>\n<li>Identify the artist by name.</li>\n<li>\n<d
 iv role="presentation">Discuss some of the main stylistic and thematic ele
 ments unique to the artist.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div role="presentation">D
 iscuss whether or not their art shares any characteristics with time perio
 ds we have studied in class--does anything about it remind you of anything
  we've studied or is it completely different.</div>\n</li>\n<li>Share one 
 observation by this artist that you found personally applicable in your ow
 n life.</li>\n</ul>\n<li>\n<p role="presentation">Write a final paragraph 
 identifying<span>&nbsp\;</span><strong>one</strong>&nbsp\;artwork from the
  episodes you watched that is your overall favorite artwork among the many
  you saw. In this final paragraph</p>\n</li>\n<ul>\n<li>Identify the artis
 t and title of the work.</li>\n<li>Explain why this particular work was yo
 ur favorite. This needs to be more than just "I like it." Write about the 
 art in detail. Write about your affinity for it in detail. This should be 
 a practice in used the language of visual art you are learning in this cou
 rse. &nbsp\;</li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class="dp-content-block dp-m
 argin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-shadow-b1 dp-border-dir-
 none" style="margin: 50px 70px 40px\; padding: 0px 35px 25px\; background-
 color: #ffffff\; color: #000000\; border-width: 5px 0px 0px\; border-color
 : #005a38\;">\n<h3 class="dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid dp-padd
 ing-direction-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr" style="border-width: 0px\; pa
 dding-left: 22px\; padding-bottom: 10px\; padding-top: 12px\; border-color
 : #005a38\; color: #ffffff\; margin: 0px -40px 30px\; font-size: 24px\; ba
 ckground-color: #005a38\;"><strong>What to Submit</strong></h3>\n<p>Submit
  your finished report as a DOCX or PDF file.</p>\n</div>\n<div class="dp-c
